# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored compiled SDK (produced by theia-native release CI — see VENDORING.md)
# Fully compiled (Nuitka wrapper + pybind11 core), kept under vendor/ and
# intentionally committed so `pip install git+https://…` works with no build
# step. Re-include the compiled artifacts under vendor/ that the patterns above
# ignore (`*.so`/`*.pyd`).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!vendor/
!vendor/**
